  "notes": "{畳|たた}む is a godan verb with two distinct meanings: to fold flat objects, and to close/shut down a business.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle\n\nSENSE 1 - TO FOLD:\n- ⟦{傘|かさ}→傘：00639_kasa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{畳|たた}む: to close/fold an umbrella\n- ⟦{布団|ふとん}→布団：01720_futon⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{畳|たた}む: to fold up a futon\n- ⟦{洗濯物|せんたくもの}→洗濯物：09533_sentakumono⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{畳|たた}む: to fold laundry\n- ⟦{服|ふく}→服：00695_fuku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{畳|たた}む: to fold clothes\n- ⟦{地図|ちず}→地図：02914_chizu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{畳|たた}む: to fold a map\n\nSENSE 2 - TO CLOSE (business):\n- ⟦{店|みせ}→店：00497_mise⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{畳|たた}む: to close down a shop\n- ⟦{会社|かいしゃ}→会社：00607_kaisha⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{畳|たた}む: to shut down a company\n- ⟦{商売|しょうばい}→商売：03239_shoubai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{畳|たた}む: to close a business\n\nWRITING:\nThe kanji {畳|たた} is the same as ⟦{畳|たたみ}→畳：02224_tatami⟧ (tatami mat), reflecting the folding/layering nature of traditional Japanese flooring.",
